WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Welcome.
-Hi. Thanks for having me.

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:03.803 size:81% position:41%
-You're very welcome.
I'm happy you're here.

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:06.072 size:81% position:41%
So you play -- this is
a adaptation of a book

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:07.807 align:start size:94% position:6%
about someone who moves to
New York

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:10.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
and lands a job at
a very prestigious restaurant.

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:12.746 line:92%
Had you waited tables before?

00:00:12.746 --> 00:00:13.346 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I had not, no.

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:16.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'd worked in a pub,
when I was very underage.

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.584 line:92%
Don't try that one at home.

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:18.952 line:92%
It's different in England, guys.

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:21.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, how young -- how young
can you be

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:23.123 line:92%
and work in a pub in England?

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:24.491 line:92%
Is it like 11 or 12 years old?

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:26.526 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I feel like I'm gonna
get in trouble.

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:29.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
Maybe. I don't know.
It's not all Oliver Twist.

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:31.765
No. I was 16, but it was kind of
similar to Tess,

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:34.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
where I had experience with,
like, difficult customers

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:37.103 align:start size:94% position:6%
for example,
and I'd put food on a bar,

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:39.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I hadn't exactly
learned the disciplines.

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:42.409
-And you had to actually get
some skill training for this.

00:00:42.409 --> 00:00:45.845
What was the hardest table
waiting skill for you to master?

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:50.283 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Like everything,
but the three-plate carry

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:51.217 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
is so difficult,

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:52.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it's a great skill
'cause I like food,

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.855
and now I can carry more food
from the kitchen to the sofa.

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:58.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So the is the three-plate
one, two, three?

00:00:58.324 --> 00:00:58.958 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah. Yeah, yeah.

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:01.061
So you put your -- you've got
one here, and then you use,

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:04.330
like, a sort of tripod, you've
got three points of contact.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sure.
-One here.

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:06.833 line:92%
And you hold the third one here.

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:07.500 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Yeah. There you go.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you ever do the big tray
with a bunch of plates?

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:13.573 size:81% position:41%
-Oh, no. No. No. No.
I'm not that advanced.

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:16.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Maybe season two.
-Maybe season two.

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:17.277 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughing ] Yeah.

00:01:17.277 --> 00:01:19.379 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, this is
an adaptation of a book,

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:22.849
and obviously people who have
read it will watch the show,

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:24.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
and see if
it's a true adaptation.

00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:27.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have done a lot of things
over your career

00:01:27.554 --> 00:01:28.755 line:92%
that have been book adaptations.

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:31.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, as a viewer, is it true
that you had issues

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:34.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
with some of
the "Harry Potter" films?

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:34.794 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, I did.

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:35.995 line:92%
When I was really, really young.

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:38.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
I used to love --
I used to read it with my dad,

00:01:38.198 --> 00:01:41.601
and I sat there on the sofa
when the first film came out,

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:42.969 line:92%
and I followed it page by page,

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:44.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I got like
three paragraphs in,

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:46.639 align:start size:94% position:6%
and had a mental breakdown.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:49.642 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because I couldn't understand
why they would do that.

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:53.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now I'm older and wiser,
and I get it now,

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:56.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
and yeah, it's hard to do
something that's well-loved.

00:01:56.349 --> 00:01:59.619
-This is in the -- You moved to
New York for this?

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:00.286 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Kind of, yeah.

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:02.655 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And do you have a different
experience now

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:03.490 line:92%
when you go to restaurants,

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:06.793 align:start size:94% position:6%
when you look at actual people
who are doing the job?

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:07.660 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-I do, yeah. I don't --

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm, like, creepily
staring at people,

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:11.631 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, trying to figure out
the dynamics.

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:15.535
Like, who is friends with who,
and, like, who just messed up?

00:02:15.535 --> 00:02:16.569 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:19.038 align:start size:94% position:6%
To them,
you look like a weird sadist.

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:19.739 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Oh yeah. Absolutely.

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:22.175 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm, like, doing my own
three-plate carry.

00:02:22.175 --> 00:02:24.544 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're like,
"What's she's doing?"

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:25.278 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah. No, for sure.

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:26.379 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You went --
You have a tattoo --

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:28.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have tattoos in real life,
a tattoo in the show.

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:29.883 line:92%
You get a tattoo in the show

00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:31.818 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you actually went
method for.

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:32.385 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, I did.

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:34.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So when we see you getting
a tattoo in the show,

00:02:34.254 --> 00:02:34.954 line:92%
that is an actual tattoo?

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:37.657
-Yeah, well, you don't see me
getting it done on the show.

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:38.258 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay, got you.

00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:39.592 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When I did my screen test,
I had these tattoos,

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:42.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they were like,
"You've got to cover those up

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:43.029 line:92%
if you want to get the job,"

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:44.964 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was like,
"Fine, whatever."

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:47.901
Episode three comes along,
and they've written in, like,

00:02:47.901 --> 00:02:49.736 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Tess has a tattoo,

00:02:49.736 --> 00:02:51.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'm like,
"I'm just gonna go get it."

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:54.207
And the producer is like, "No."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:54.974 line:92%
"You're not gonna do that."

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:57.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I came into work, and I got
it, and I was with my mum.

00:02:57.644 --> 00:02:59.646 size:81% position:41%
She came to visit me
in New York that week,

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:01.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
and so she, like, sat next
to me. She's like --

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:04.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
She'd been against me
getting tattoos for, like,

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:05.285 size:88% position:44% line:92%
all 21 years of my life,

00:03:05.285 --> 00:03:07.620 size:88% position:44%
but suddenly she's like,
"I'm gonna get one too."

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now I can't stop her.
-Oh, no.

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:10.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She has so many.
She won't stop.

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:12.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like she's addicted
to the ink.

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:13.393 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.393 --> 00:03:14.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is one of
those weird cases

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:16.996 align:start size:94% position:6%
where the child is a terrible
influence on the parent.

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:18.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-I think so, yeah.

00:03:18.131 --> 00:03:20.433 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Now you're gonna start
having to worry about

00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:23.570
who she's hanging out with,
what time she gets home.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:23.970 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I know.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.238 size:81% position:41%
-Is this a picture of
the tattoo that you --

00:03:25.238 --> 00:03:27.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. These are the matching
tattoos we got.

00:03:27.774 --> 00:03:28.474 line:92%
-See, that's really nice.

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:30.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they're not too bad
of all the tattoos

00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:31.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
you could have gotten.
-Yeah.

00:03:31.878 --> 00:03:33.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And as moms go,
I think it's very classy.

00:03:33.613 --> 00:03:35.682
-Yeah, she is a cool mom.
She's badass. She's cool.

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:37.984 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, no -- I -- look,
that's official at this point.

00:03:37.984 --> 00:03:41.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, I hope my mom is watching
because you've let me down.

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:41.821 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:43.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, thank you so much
for being here.

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:45.258 size:84% position:42% line:92%
I really appreciate it.

